# Read by `pnpm build:hosted` (Vite's "hosted" mode): the settings of the published helper page.
# Not secret: both end up in the page anyone can load. A variable set in the shell wins over this file.

# The signaling relay, as the page connects to it.
VITE_RELAY_URL=https://light-assist-relay.francescomazzella.workers.dev

# The Microsoft Store listing, once the app is live there; the Windows download button then leads to it.
# Partner Center shows the address, https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/<Store ID>. Until then, leave it out.
# VITE_STORE_URL=https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/
